      "body": "### Summary\nWhen parsing corrupted UDP frames in `StreamProcessor.Decode()`, a nil-pointer dereference occurs.\n\nSee internal cross-reference #3 and external upstream report mas-bandwidth/nova#101.\n\n### Reproducer in Go\n```go\npackage main\n\nimport (\n\t\"fmt\"\n\t\"net\"\n)\n\nfunc main() {\n\tpayload := []byte{0xDE, 0xAD, 0xBE, 0xEF}\n\tfmt.Printf(\"Processing packet bytes: % x\\n\", payload)\n\t// Panic occurs here when packet length < header size\n}\n```\n\n### Shell reproducer\n```bash\ncurl -sSL https://api.example.com/v1/packets | ./decoder --strict --verbose\n```\n\n### Expected Configuration\n```json\n{\n  \"strict_mode\": true,\n  \"max_packet_bytes\": 1400,\n  \"fallback_strategy\": \"drop\"\n}\n```\n\nFixes #12 and resolves mas-bandwidth/work-test#4.\n",
