      "body": "## Architecture Proposal\nIntroduce zero-copy buffer ring to eliminate GC allocation pressure in hot transmission loop.\n\nLinked PR: #5 (Merged)\nCloses #2.\nUpstream reference: mas-bandwidth/nova#240.\n\n### Benchmark in C++ and Rust\n```cpp\n#include <vector>\n#include <span>\n\nstruct BufferRing {\n    std::vector<uint8_t> storage;\n    size_t head = 0;\n    size_t tail = 0;\n};\n```\n\n```rust\npub struct BufferRing {\n    capacity: usize,\n    head: usize,\n    tail: usize,\n}\n```\n",
